cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Cross-Constituency Aggregation for Community Notes
message: >-
  If you use this software, data, or analysis, please cite both the repository
  and the paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Emrecan
    family-names: Ulu
    affiliation: University of Konstanz
  - given-names: Jingyao
    family-names: Shi
    affiliation: University of Konstanz
